ge":0,"reviews":"\u201cNice small puzzle game for chess fans, good puzzles. Took me 108 minutes to complete the 30 levels.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201cThis game has interested chess related puzzles. To see everything moving and trying to figure out next move is challenging. Sometimes it melts your brain making calculations for every move, and because of that, I love this game.  I really wanted to see a sequel for this game. :)\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201cThis game is a masterpiece. The design is simple, is easy to understand, and you can spend hours playing and thinking about you next move. If you get caught by the enemy, soon you'll start to think about new routes and what you did wrong, this is so fun. The pieces moving in sync it's so good to watch. SUPER recommend if you like puzzle and peace of mind games. Just take your time and play it.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404190/ss_978970ff9534b6387bc542ee14c388cc18a6218e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1621027485","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404190/ss_978970ff9534b6387bc542ee14c388cc18a6218e.600x338.jpg?t=1621027485"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404190/ss_18d7a093b36ff1c2458b16ce22f0df7e04931424.1920x1080.jpg?t=1621027485","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404190/ss_18d7a093b36ff1c2458b16ce22f0df7e04931424.600x338.jpg?t=1621027485"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404190/ss_0673f9b1056d07850173a839e3c9d503bbe7bf81.1920x1080.jpg?t=1621027485","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404190/ss_0673f9b1056d07850173a839e3c9d503bbe7bf81.600x338.jpg?t=1621027485"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app